# error-value-junk-after-quoted

## Input

```
a "value" extra
b "ok" # comment

```

## CST

```
SOURCE_FILE@0..33
  ENTRY@0..16
    WORD_KEY@0..1
      WORD@0..1 "a"
    SPACE@1..2 " "
    QUOTED_STRING@2..9
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@2..3 "\""
      STRING@3..8 "value"
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@8..9 "\""
    SPACE@9..10 " "
    ERROR@10..15
      STRING@10..15 "extra"
    NEWLINE@15..16 "\n"
  ENTRY@16..33
    WORD_KEY@16..17
      WORD@16..17 "b"
    SPACE@17..18 " "
    QUOTED_STRING@18..22
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@18..19 "\""
      STRING@19..21 "ok"
      DOUBLE_QUOTE@21..22 "\""
    COMMENT@22..32 " # comment"
    NEWLINE@32..33 "\n"
```

## Syntax Error

```
[
    SyntaxError {
        message: "unexpected token after value",
        range: 10..15,
    },
]
```

## AST

```
SourceFile {
    items: [
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@0..1 "a",
            },
            value: QuotedString {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@2..3 "\"",
                string: STRING@3..8 "value",
                close_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@8..9 "\"",
            },
        },
        Entry {
            key: WordKey {
                word: WORD@16..17 "b",
            },
            value: QuotedString {
                open_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@18..19 "\"",
                string: STRING@19..21 "ok",
                close_quote: DOUBLE_QUOTE@21..22 "\"",
            },
        },
    ],
}
```

